&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The California base pay range for this position is $75,000 to $85,000 per year with eligibility for generous commissions, equity, and healthcare insurance. &amp;nbsp;The total compensation package offered to a successful candidate will depend on several factors, which may include, but are not limited to, the type and length of experience applicable to the role and within the industry, job-related skills, job level, and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job-preview__description &quot; data-test-description=&quot;&quot;&gt;
