&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is currently seeking an experienced Physical Therapist Assistant, PTA, for a full-time opportunity performing home health visits Davidson County Visits office.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;This position services adult and geriatric patients on a per visit basis in homes throughout Chatham, Lee and NE Randolph counties in North Carolina.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
