&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To learn more about BAYADA Benefits, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bayada.com/benefits/&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
